# Note: files/*.xlsx is deliberately NOT ignored — the "choose from prepared Excel
# files" list on the upload screen reads this repo's files/ folder via a Cloudflare
# Pages Function (see README), so an .xlsx only shows up there once it's actually
# committed and pushed. This is only safe to keep un-ignored while the GitHub repo
# itself is private (see README's setup steps) — if it's ever made public again,
# reinstate an ignore rule here before pushing real data (other alliances' player
# names, etc.).

# Claude Code — local project settings/permissions, machine-specific.
.claude/

# VSCode / JetBrains — local editor/workspace settings, machine-specific.
.vscode/
.idea/

# macOS / Windows filesystem cruft.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Editor swap/backup files.
*.swp
*.swo
*~
